      ],
      "text": "9.1\t C",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        125.42900085449219,
        235.6632537841797,
        137.2281951904297
      ],
      "text": "hapter objectives",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        145.97100830078125,
        513.4259033203125,
        159.322509765625
      ],
      "text": "Although TB is common in children, there is little research that investigates the issues",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        161.967529296875,
        429.4758605957031,
        175.31903076171875
      ],
      "text": "related to this field. Indeed, children are often excluded from research.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        186.40505981445312,
        513.4376831054688,
        199.8255615234375
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for national tuberculosis  During the development of this second edition of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        202.40158081054688,
        513.426025390625,
        215.82208251953125
      ],
      "text": "programmes on the management of childhood tuberculosis,  it became clear that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        218.46710205078125,
        513.4605102539062,
        231.818603515625
      ],
      "text": "insufficient evidence is available to allow formulation of recommendations on every",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        234.463623046875,
        513.3570556640625,
        247.81512451171875
      ],
      "text": "aspect of the management of children with TB and children in families with TB. The",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        250.46014404296875,
        513.4603881835938,
        263.8116455078125
      ],
      "text": "Steering Committee and the Panel therefore compiled a list of research priorities that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        266.4566650390625,
        513.4144287109375,
        279.80816650390625
      ],
      "text": "could guide future revisions of this document. This is not meant to be a comprehensive",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        282.45318603515625,
        513.4144897460938,
        295.8046875
      ],
      "text": "list of the research required but complements a research agenda for child TB published",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        298.3807067871094,
        513.4835815429688,
        311.80120849609375
      ],
      "text": "(1, 2) by WHO in 2007 and 2011  . The Childhood TB roadmap also highlights research",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        314.3772277832031,
        146.3804168701172,
        327.7977294921875
      ],
      "text": "(3). priorities",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        338.9527282714844,
        513.3915405273438,
        352.3042297363281
      ],
      "text": "This chapter summarizes and highlights important research priorities identified by all",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        354.94921875,
        513.4721069335938,
        368.30072021484375
      ],
      "text": "those involved in the process of preparing this guidance (see “Acknowledgements”",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        370.9457092285156,
        129.13040161132812,
        384.2972106933594
      ],
